From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Amaan Qureshi <git@amaanq.com>
Date: Sun, 11 Jan 2026 00:00:00 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] enable Vanadium extension code support

Upstream 151 defines ENABLE_DESKTOP_ANDROID_EXTENSIONS for real (args.gn
turns it on), so this no longer renames that buildflag; those sites stay
upstream. IS_DESKTOP_ANDROID_VANADIUM switches only the C++ sites the
extension platform needs on a phone build. Keeps the genuine fixes:
component-extension webstore icon IDRs don't exist with phone resources,
current_channel_logo tripped CHECK_IS_TEST on non-branded stable, and
SharedPrefsUtils.REGISTRY registration for debug-assert builds.
---
 chrome/browser/chrome_browser_field_trials.cc |  5 +++
 .../browser/chrome_content_browser_client.cc  |  2 +-
 ...me_component_extension_resource_manager.cc |  4 +++
 .../extensions/favicon/favicon_util.cc        | 12 ++++++-
